build/
compile_commands.json
*.o
*.swp

# User state, which is the whole reason this app exists and must never be in
# a commit. NOT `data/` wholesale -- brokers.json and pagerules.json are
# download-only assets and belong in git. These three are what the RUNNING app
# writes, and one of them (egress.json) holds naked_exit: the user's address
# with the tunnel DOWN. A privacy tool that publishes the recorded location it
# exists to protect would be the worst bug this project could ship, and until
# s12 moved state out of the tree it was one `git add -A` away.
data/egress.json
data/cases.json
data/*.log

# Reference docs live in their own repo -- never vendor them here.
RULES.md
CANON.md
HANDOFF.md
ARC.md
ARCHITECTURE.md
BOOK.md
docs/
